title: RIP phase-4 proof — checkout soak in prod
description: Six seconds of oha against the proof's second checkout build, the one that serves environment prod on its own port, sampled every second. It runs while the demo soak is running, so each run's window holds the spans of both builds and each run must still record only the version of its own environment.

tags[2]: proof, performance
kind: performance
target:
  system: checkout
  technology: http
  environment: prod

load:
  tool: oha
  script: http://127.0.0.1:44382/
  vus: 2
  duration_s: 6
  profile:
    type: soak
    sample_interval_s: 1

method[1]:
  - name: hold-for-the-soak
    activity_type: probe
    provider:
      type: process
      path: sh
      arguments[2]: "-c", "sleep 7 && curl -fsS -o /dev/null http://127.0.0.1:44382/ready"
      timeout_s: 60.0

rollbacks[0]:
